  "collection_notes": "Board page (washingtoncountyor.gov/bcc) lists Fai as District 1 Commissioner and Treece as District 2 Commissioner; neither holds the at-large Chair seat, so incumbent=false for this race. The board page also reports Chair Kathryn Harrington announced her resignation (Sept 2026), so the Chair seat is vacant/pro tem until the election. Campaign domains are printed in the county pamphlet statements. Fai's site still describes her as running for a second term (2024 content), so no items were taken from it; Treece's site duplicated pamphlet themes, so no separate items. Pamphlet quotes are capped at ~125 characters by the fetch tool, so items use short excerpts.",
